  "notes": "FORMS:\n{試|し} (trial, test) + {算|さん} (calculation) → trial calculation\n\nCAN FUNCTION AS:\n- Noun: {試算|しさん}を{行|おこな}う (to conduct a trial calculation)\n- Suru-verb: {試算|しさん}する (to make a trial calculation)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {試算|しさん}{表|ひょう} (trial balance - accounting term)\n- {試算|しさん}{結果|けっか} (results of trial calculation)\n- ～と{試算|しさん}される (to be estimated at ~)\n\nUSAGE:\nCommonly used in:\n- Government policy announcements\n- Business planning and budgeting\n- Financial analysis\n- Project feasibility studies\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {概算|がいさん} (rough estimate)\n- {見積|みつも}り (estimate, quotation)\n- {計算|けいさん} (calculation - general)\n- {精算|せいさん} (exact calculation, settlement)",
